  <h1>Stream into Telegram<br />group calls, from <em>Node.js</em>.</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    Thread-safe Rust bindings for <code>libntgcalls</code> — the WebRTC engine behind Telegram voice
    and video chats. Bring your MTProto client; this handles the media. Works on Node.js and Bun.
  </p>

